sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Dashboard as Web Dashboard / CLI
    participant API as FastAPI Gateway
    participant GitHub as GitHub REST API
    participant WS as Workspace Manager
    participant RAG as RAG Ingestion Service

    User->>Dashboard: Submit Repo URL (https://github.com/owner/repo)
    Dashboard->>API: POST /api/v1/github/validate
    API->>GitHub: GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}
    GitHub-->>API: 200 OK (Metadata, default branch, permissions)
    API-->>Dashboard: Validation Success (Public/Private verified)

    User->>Dashboard: Execute "Clone & Ingest"
    Dashboard->>API: POST /api/v1/repositories/clone
    API->>WS: Prepare isolated directory (workspaces/{project_id}/{sha})
    WS->>GitHub: Shallow git clone --depth 1
    WS-->>API: Clone completed with Head Commit SHA
    API->>RAG: Trigger Async AST Ingestion
    RAG->>WS: Read tracked files (.gitignore filtered)
    RAG->>RAG: AST Chunking & Hash Fingerprinting
    RAG-->>API: Ingestion Complete (Chunks stored in ChromaDB)
    API-->>Dashboard: Repository Ready for Multi-Agent Workflows
